\f0\fs22\b Usage telemetry\b0\par
Scarlet sends usage reports to PostHog in the US by default. They cover app starts, feature use, tasks, exports, and whether you keep an applied edit, send a revision or request Undo edit. An anonymous installation ID links usage over time. A separate code links decisions about the same edit. Reports exclude media, transcripts, prompts, edit titles and revision text.\par
Turn Send usage reports off in Settings \u8594? About to stop reporting.\par
